          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homes, the ArmaFlex LapSeal tube is the best pipe insulation: thick, flexible and self-sealing for hot and cold lines. Choose the Tubolit carton for long basement runs, the M-D or Duck tubes for short runs, Frost King fiberglass for odd shapes, and FV15 tape to seal fittings and joints.
          </p>
